      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "The refresh pattern already works for the Edge Class template",
        "observation": "In the running app, editing a Property or a stroke, or adding or removing a stroke node, re-rendered the template's icon, summary and detail views through class-scoped Handlers, the graph structure event, and one Method that re-reads every node and writes the stored views. Turning the structure Handler off left the views stale, which shows the Handler is what does the work.",
        "kind": "prototype",
        "strength": "strong",
        "definitionKey": "idea-evidence",
