        "view": {
          "intent": "node",
          "payload": "node.web.detail"
        },
        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# The Page Template\n\nA full page view organized as a graph of named pieces: masthead, hero, sections, callouts, routes, media, aside and footer. Pieces are ordinary nodes, and one Handler and Method keep the page view current from them.\n\nStarted from scratch, informed by the Public Arrival Template and the Edge Class template's refresh pattern. The first page it should build is the front door, `github://mikemartinez1974/public/ideas/twilite-front-door/root.node`."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "ownsContent": true,
          "surfaceDelegation": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "page-template"
        }
      }
    },
