      "data": {
        "title": "Is the page view stored or derived at render?",
        "question": "Should the assembled page be stored as the graph's document view and refreshed by events, or derived from the pieces every time it is shown?",
        "status": "open",
        "answer": "The template builds the document from the pieces' views and returns them stacked in one view node for the consumer page. Whether that view node is stored and refreshed by events, or derived when shown, is still open. Stored keeps the file correct for any client but goes stale if the Handler is off. Derived is always current but only the app can show it.",
