      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": false,
      "data": {
        "title": "Eight roles recur across the pages",
        "observation": "Across the nine pages with real parts, the recurring parts sort into masthead (9 of 9), route list (7 of 9), section (5), region holding graph content (2, the gallery and the workboard), callout in the form of a challenge, checkpoint or contact note (2), footer or way back (2), and secondary or utility list and summary (1 page each, both also present in templates). Only the parts that are infrastructure, domain content, or an article did not fit a role, and none of the pages needed a part outside that list.",
        "kind": "observation",
        "strength": "moderate",
        "definitionKey": "idea-evidence",
